{"id":"n30185-1-38","stage":1,"title":"장소 · 场所","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30185-1-38-1","ko":"이번 수학여행 장소는 학생들이 직접 정한다면서?","zh":"听说这次修学旅行去哪儿由学生自己决定？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수학여행","meaning":"(学校组织的)参观活动，学习旅行","explanation":"수학여행：(学校组织的)参观活动，学习旅行","readings":[{"term":"수학여행","audio":"/audio/8aecbf0cd13e3bf8336e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64721","senseId":"1","lemma":"수학여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장소는","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학생들이","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정한다면서?","meaning":"定，选定","explanation":"정하다：定，选定；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"8aecbf0cd13e3bf8","term":"수학여행","zh":"(学校组织的)参观活动，学习旅行","audio":"/audio/8aecbf0cd13e3bf8336e.mp3","entryId":"64721","definition":"教学活动之一，为拓宽知识，学生在教师的指导下通过实地观察而进行的旅行。","pronunciation":["수항녀행"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","term":"정하다","zh":"定，选定","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3","entryId":"29767","definition":"从几个里面选一个。","pronunciation":["정ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c40047183cb4fbcf492d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30185-1-38-2","ko":"응, 나는 제주도에 가고 싶어.","zh":"嗯，我想去济州岛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제주도에","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"가고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶어.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f73231b4f51bc4d6b21.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.97,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30185","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3944,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，我想去济州岛。","听说这次修学旅行去哪儿由学生自己决定？","智秀小姐完全不吃肉吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说这次修学旅行去哪儿由学生自己决定？","智秀小姐完全不吃肉吗？","嗯，我想去济州岛。"],"answer":2}]}
